  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Zhen Yuan Zi’s formation holds an immemorial desolate beast green claw ghost winged lion for a qualified Gu Immortal inheritor to suppress or control. When Gu Master Han Li inherits without immortal essence, the formation breaks, sand wakes the hill-sized sleeping lion, and it leaps forward and swallows him whole.",
      "chapters": [
        1411
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhen_yuan_zi",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "char_han_li"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dancer Hong Yun later recognizes the beast as an immemorial desolate beast when it appears.",
      "chapters": [
        1412
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dancer_hong_yun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It has a huge, hill-sized body. Its ghost wings are thin and unfitting when it is in poor condition, and it has black claws.",
      "chapters": [
        1411
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The species eats souls as food. In Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s era it was common; by the present it is very rare. It counters soul path and was a huge hurdle for Spectral Soul in his youth. He later killed such lions, excavated their innate talent, and at rank eight often captured them to create the soul devouring method.",
      "chapters": [
        1413
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "nature-and-spectral-soul",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Thousand Transformations’ will judges the lion under Zhen Yuan Zi’s formation is not in good condition: ghost wings weak, deep internal injuries, only ancient desolate level battle strength, and useless ghost wings. Mutation Immortal Gu turns its tail into a venomous python and grows ghost crying trees from its fur, then mutates its right eye into a venomous bee that stabs into its brain. The lion crashes into the desert and dies. Inside its stomach Dancer Hong Yun finds Han Li alive because the soul-eating beast left his physical body intact.",
      "chapters": [
        1413
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zhen-yuan-zi-specimen",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_thousand_transformations_ancestor",
        "gu_mutation_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because of the lion, Han Li does not refine the formation spirit or the other Gu worms even after inheriting.",
      "chapters": [
        1414
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zhen-yuan-zi-specimen",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    }
  ],
